[{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0010","text":"好厉害啊，手作的万花筒……\n这是碎片重叠形成的偶然图案吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0020","text":"是的……\n重叠起来……闪闪发亮……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0025","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0030","text":"因为平时……总是……\n从您那里……得到很多……\n光……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0035","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0040","text":"所以……希望也能……\n传达给制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0045","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10108003_00_0050","text":"很多的光……"}]
